              "who": "trout_dad",
              "text": "sam has a show now"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "PASTOR GABRIEL",
          "text": "Tonight's word is {slow}soak.{/slow} Not rinse. Not splash. Soak.",
          "comments": [
            {
              "who": "jessrn",
              "text": "why is he whispering"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(A sock puppet with button eyes rises over the pulpit. It does not say hello.)",
          "comments": [
            {
              "who": "nightcrawler",
              "text": "BROTHER BUBBLES"
            },
            {
              "who": "dusty_ray",
              "text": "this puppet has seen things"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "PASTOR GABRIEL",
          "text": "Brother Bubbles asks: Pastor, why do we go under the water? Well, Bubbles, because everything that floats is lying.",
          "comments": [
            {
              "who": "lakelady",
              "text": "WHAT"
            },
            {
              "who": "jessrn",
              "text": "@{handle} explain this"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CALLER",
          "text": "Hi Sam, love the show. Is it safe to swim yet?",
          "comments": [
            {
              "who": "trout_dad",
              "text": "good question"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "PASTOR GABRIEL",
          "text": "Gabriel, child. And safety is a feeling.",
          "comments": [
            {
              "who": "dusty_ray",
              "text": "he didnt answer"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "PASTOR GABRIEL",
          "text": "Baptisms every Sunday at the lake. Everyone's welcome. Everyone. We don't keep a list.{pause:800} The county does.",
          "comments": [
            {
              "who": "nightcrawler",
              "text": "my grandma goes every week"
            },
            {
              "who": "lakelady",
              "text": "he blinked weird"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(The puppet sways. The organ plays one note, and holds it a little too long.)",
          "comments": [
            {
              "who": "jessrn",
              "text": "turn it off turn it off"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "PASTOR GABRIEL",
          "text": "Remember, Lake Ulysses: what goes down clean comes up {slow}clean.{/slow} Goodnight.",
          "holdMs": 5000,
          "comments": [
            {
              "who": "trout_dad",
              "text": "comes up how"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
